\par \{bmc bm3.bmp\}\tab Creating new Objects and dragging them onto the datazone
\par 
\par When you have completed your modifications
\par \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\tab Lock the datazone by selecting it, clicking on it with the right mouse button and selecting \b Properties\plain\fs22  - \b Lock this panel
