{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} How to Adjust Focus}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} How_to_Adjust_Focus}
{\up >}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up >} main}
\pard\keepn {\up K}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up K} Adjust focus}
\b\fs28 How to Adjust Focus\plain\fs36 
\par \pard \fs24 
\par Focus is adjusted in order to obtain a sharp image revealing small detail if present in the specimen. Optimum focus may be obstructed through presence of noise so that \uldb noise reduction\plain\fs24 {\v How_to_Noise_Reduce_and_Freeze_the_Image} must be applied.\uldb  Astigmatism\plain\fs24 {\v How_to_Correct_for_Astigmatism} may also distort the image and must be corrected.
\par 
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\tab \ul Click\plain\fs24 {\v CLICK@SEM.HLP} on \{bmc bm4.bmp\} to switch mouse operation to magnification and \ul Working Distance\plain\fs24 {\v 1YCGPIR@SEM.HLP} (C3-lens) adjustment.
\par \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\tab With the left mouse button adjust a suitable magnification. A suitable magnification is set when larger details in the image can be seen but smaller details are unsharp. Begin from low magnification upwards.
\par \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\tab With the middle mouse button adjust Working Distance to bring the focus plane to the specimen surface which results in a sharper image.
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\tab Repeat the above two steps at higher magnification if necessary. For an optimum setting adjust focus at a magnification of 5 to 10 times higher than the final magnification in the micrograph will be.
\par \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\tab If \uldb astigmatism\plain\fs24 {\v 7TVA0H0@SEM.HLP} shows up \uldb correct for astigmatism.\plain\fs24 {\v How_to_Correct_for_Astigmatism}
\par 
\par 
\par \pard\tx355 \{bmc bm5.bmp\}\tab \uldb \fs22 Focus Adjustment\plain\fs22 {\v 14WB9QP@SEM.HLP}
\par \tab \uldb Focusing on the Specimen\plain\fs22 {\v 21C3A5V@SEM.HLP}
\par \tab \uldb Mag/Focus Mode\plain\fs22 {\v 13FWPVG@SEM.HLP}
\par \tab \uldb Moving the Specimen to FocusPlane\plain\fs22 {\v 1HZD_OA@SEM.HLP}
\par \tab \uldb Auto Focus\plain\fs22 {\v 11EGDP8@SEM.HLP}\fs24 
