\b\fs28 How to Align the Electron Beam\plain\fs36 
\par \pard\tx355 \fs24 
\par \pard\tx355 \fs22 The electron beam must be aligned onto the electron optical axis of the column to achieve good performance.
\par \pard\tx355 \fs24 
\par \pard\tx355 \fs22 
\par \pard\tx355 
\par \pard\tx355 See \uldb Setting Filament current and aligning the beam\plain\fs22 {\v S5.G0D@operation.hlp}
\par \page
{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} How to Annotate the Image}
